    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Using its tentacles to lash itself to\ntrees, it lies in wait for prey, luring it\nclose with sweet-smelling drool.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/22/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "あまい　においの　だえきで　えものを\nおびきよせ　おおあごで　がぶり。\n１にち　かけて　えものを　たべる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "달콤한 냄새의 타액으로 먹이를\n끌어들여 큰 턱으로 꿀꺽한다.\n하루에 걸쳐 먹이를 먹는다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il attire sa proie avec sa salive odorante avant de\nla croquer. Il lui faut une journée pour l’avaler.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sein süßlich riechender Speichel zieht Beute an,\ndie es frisst. Es braucht einen Tag, sie zu fressen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Atrae a sus presas con saliva de olor dulce y las\nmastica. Tarda todo un día en comérselas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Attira le prede con il dolce aroma della saliva e poi\nle ingoia. Impiega un giorno per mangiare una preda.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It attracts prey with its sweet-smelling saliva, then\nchomps down. It takes a whole day to eat prey.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "甘い　においの　だえきで　獲物を\nおびき寄せ　おおあごで　がぶり。\n１日　かけて　獲物を　食べる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Atrae a sus presas con saliva de olor dulce y las\nmastica. Tarda todo un día en comérselas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "しっちたいに　はえる　きにまきつき\nあまいかおりの　だえきで　えものを\nおびきよせては　ひとくちで　たべる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "늪지대에서 자라는 나무에 엉겨 붙어\n달콤한 냄새의 타액으로 먹이를\n끌어들여 한입에 먹는다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il s’accroche aux arbres des marais et attire ses proies\navec sa salive à l’odeur enivrante.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Klammert sich an Bäume in Sümpfen. Lockt Beute mit\nseinem süßlichen Speichel an und schluckt sie dann.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se cuelga de los árboles en los pantanos. Atrae a sus\npresas con su dulce olor y las engulle.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si attacca agli alberi nelle paludi. Attrae le prede\ncon il dolce aroma della saliva e poi le ingoia.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
